            MassTransferCoefficient    0.150   // [1/s] Linear Driving Force (LDF) mass transfer coefficient (Kl)
            AxialDispersionCoefficient 0E-06   // [m^2/s] Axial dispersion coefficient (D_ax)
            
            AdsorptionHeat             22000     // [J/mol] Isosteric heat of adsorption (Delta H)
            AdsorptionHeat_1           28000   // [J/mol] Isosteric heat of adsorption for Layer 1
            
            MassTransferCoefficient_1  0.063   // [1/s] LDF mass transfer coefficient for Layer 1
            AxialDispersionCoefficient_1 0E-06 // [m^2/s] Axial dispersion coefficient for Layer 1
            
            Layer 0                              
            NumberOfIsothermSites      1       // [-] Number of distinct adsorption sites/mechanisms
            Langmuir-Freundlich-T      1.79739	 2.0743e-08   1.45554    //7.11232  2.05261e-05  0.782682 0 0     7.11232  1.337397e-07  0.782682 1500.0 1500.0
            Layer 1                               
